<title>FINLAND: Raisio sets July 16 London briefings.</title>
<headline>Raisio sets July 16 London briefings.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food, animal feed and chemicals group Raision Tehtaat on Tuesday said it will hold joint briefings in London with its new partner McNeil Consumer Products on Wednesday, July 16.</p>
<p>Raisio top management plans two briefings in the City of London, one for equities analysts at 1000/0900 GMT and one for institutions and fund managers at 1300/1200 GMT, Raisio spokesman Sten von Hellens told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;A McNeil representative will attend,&quot; von Hellens said.</p>
<p>Raisio announced earlier a partnership with McNeil -- part of U.S. group Johnson &amp; Johnson -- to use its Benecol cholestrol reducing stanol ester in a variety of forms to be introduced to the North American market.</p>
<p>-- John Acher, Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
